                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>This meeting is recorded in the Log, <hi rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref
                        target="#pg840">p. 840</ref>. While no record of the discussion has been
                    found, the principal subject was presumably the attack led by Gibson which had
                    destroyed the Möhne and Eder Dams. See Churchill, <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Closing the Ring</hi>, p. 68.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
